WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.478
Sam is planning a team offsite in Lisbon. From the palette, Sam opens a travel guide beside the plan.

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:25.750
Sam asks the agent to open Belém in the guide and fill Friday afternoon.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:32.565
The agent opens the Belém page in the guide and writes three stops into the plan.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:41.620
Sam asks for light mode.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:48.928
Work turns light, everywhere at once.

00:00:48.928 --> 00:01:02.528
Sam asks for a workflow that checks Friday's forecast every morning.

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:09.306
The workflow is saved to the project. Sam opens it: a schedule, the forecast check, a message to the chat.

00:01:09.306 --> 00:01:23.439
Sam asks for an app for the team with the plan, the forecast and who's joining what.

00:01:23.439 --> 00:01:29.310
The app is ready. From the palette, Sam opens it beside the workflow.

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:41.095
In the app, Sam picks a name, sees Friday's live forecast, and joins a stop on the Belém walk.
